{"id":70,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"光と塩の理念で個性を他者のために生かす","feature_description":"光塩女子学院は、カトリックの価値観を基盤に、一人ひとりがかけがえのない存在であることを大切にします。「光と塩」を学校目標に、自己と他者を共に尊重する心を育み、個性を他者のために生かす「Women for Others」を目指します。中高6年間を通してさまざまな教育活動に取り組み、日々の学びや学校生活で自分の可能性を見つけ、その力を社会の中で役立てる姿勢を養います。","clubs":[{"id":903,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":904,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":905,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":906,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":907,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":908,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":909,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":910,"name":"卓球愛好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":911,"name":"E.S.S.部（英語部）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":912,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":913,"name":"料理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":914,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/jh/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":915,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koen-ejh.ed.jp/j